From b9000ea2629ab70c7abd86706f0f1ceadfcf3a0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:00:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] VACUNIT-1203 (web): the Vacuum Unit hardware buttons and live
 values (see the C++ commit of the same name)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

page/ht9045_vacuumunit_c.js section (3): the hardware half is no longer disabled.
- On open (after editlist.get = golden FormShow) the page sends vacuum.open, then
  vacuum.get {act:'timer'} every second (golden tmr1Timer); HT_WIN open=false (or a snapshot
  saying the window is not open in wb_serve) stops it and sends vacuum.close.
- Each panel shows what C++ drew: current value, threshold, Event text and colour, the vacuum
  OK LED, and the ^ / v colours from the DO read-back; a value that cannot be read is grey,
  not "off".
- A button is unlocked only when the snapshot says available; otherwise it stays locked and
  its tooltip (and the status bar, on a click) gives C++'s reason, e.g. "ring 1 上沒有站 0x20"
  or the real module name at 0x50 that is not in the ECAT-VC8 table. The browser decides no
  interlock itself.
- Set / ^ / v / Set All (in, index, out) / Reset: a confirm dialog with the station, VC, DO
  channel or SDO address and the value, then control.takeover + the command; the status bar
  says per write: sent to the card / DRY RUN / refused (why) / card error. After Set All the
  arm's edSV inputs take (int)kPa like golden (saved only by Save).
- The Set All inputs are no longer disabled; their keypad is golden edSetInArmClick
  (VacuumUnit.cpp:599, N_DOUBLE -116..148).
- Save / Exit unchanged. HW.VacuumUnit.html unchanged.

Checked offline in headless Edge with a stub recipe client (no network, no wb_serve): no VC8
= all 32 panel Set buttons and every ^ / v locked with the reason, a click sends nothing;
a fake VC8 on the InArm station unlocks only the InArm panels and Set All InArm; ^, Set,
Set All send the expected commands after the confirm; a refused press shows "沒有送出" with
the reason; closing the window sends vacuum.close and locks everything.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
